The Get Smart costs more and does more at the counter. Without hitting the revenue tiers, the Get Clássica costs R$ 79,90/month and the Get Smart costs R$ 129,90/month [prod-get-tap-03][prod-todas-as-maquininhas-04].

The Get Smart is a smart terminal. On the device you can:
- manage stock, take orders, close tabs, load a menu and issue invoices [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10];
- integrate it with your business system [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10];
- replace the computer and fiscal printer at the counter, including issuing the fiscal receipt [sup-duvidas-get-smart-08];
- reconcile payments by credit, debit, store credit, QR Code or cash [sup-duvidas-get-smart-08].

The sources don't describe the Get Clássica's features, so I can't compare the two beyond price. I can pass your question to a human agent if you want that comparison.
